# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values, or export these
# directly in your shell. Never commit a file containing real values.
#
# ENVOY_COOKIE: the full value of the `Cookie` request header from a
# logged-in dashboard.envoy.com tab. In Chrome DevTools: Network tab, click
# any request to app.envoy.com, open Headers, copy the whole `cookie` value
# under Request Headers.
ENVOY_COOKIE=

# ENVOY_CSRF_TOKEN: the value of the `csrf_token` cookie specifically
# (a substring of ENVOY_COOKIE above). Envoy rotates it after every booking,
# so re-extract it if the script starts failing with 401s.
ENVOY_CSRF_TOKEN=
